WEBVTT

00:00:00.675 --> 00:00:02.825
On its own, this policy fails.

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:05.400
It was cloned from reward-free play data.

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:10.225
With ABI, the same policy, from the same
start and with the same random seed,

00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:11.362
succeeds.

00:00:11.412 --> 00:00:15.150
ABI only decides which
action chunk to run next.

00:00:16.675 --> 00:00:19.375
Here is the same comparison on more tasks,

00:00:19.425 --> 00:00:22.137
from the same start with the same random seed.

00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:24.975
On its own, the walker falls and crawls,

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.400
and the quadruped flips onto its back.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:30.463
With ABI choosing the chunks, both walk.

00:00:30.513 --> 00:00:34.025
In the maze, only the steered
policy reaches the goal.
